      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Jumlah frame yang\ndiproses per detik.\nKebalikan dari latency.\n\nFPS = 1000 / latency(ms)\n43 ms -> 1000/43 ~ 23 FPS\n\nReal-time smart-bin:\nbutuh min. ~15-30 FPS.\n\nMakin BESAR makin CEPAT.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Jumlah frame yang\ndiproses per detik.\nKebalikan dari latency.\n\nFPS = 1000 / latency(ms)\n43 ms -> 1000/43 ~ 23 FPS\n\nReal-time smart-bin:\nbutuh min. ~15-30 FPS.\n\nMakin BESAR makin CEPAT.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
    },

